# Architecture

The complete SRAM array consists of the following building blocks:

- 64 × 9T SRAM Cells
- Row Decoder
- Column Decoder
- Precharge Circuit
- Write Driver
- Transmission Gates (TG)
- Multiplexers
- Sense Amplifier (SA)

Together, these blocks enable accurate addressing, writing, reading, and future Compute-in-Memory operations.

